"h": "3. Design Decisions",
"md": "\nNo review finding against this component: the events-primary substitution does not change what it does. The design decisions that remain are build decisions. Two directions with almost nothing in common. Inbound is now a standby file path that must prove a file was generated and held. Outbound is a live submission loop with a validation gate, a payload record, a push receiver and a backstop poller, none of which exist.",
