"h": "11. Recommendation",
"md": "\nRedefine this component around micro-batch cadence and consumer lag rather than a batch lane that runs more often.\n\n**Action.** Redefine around micro-batch cadence and consumer lag.\n\n**Hub · orchestration.** Answer the run-id contradiction before anything else on this plane is built. Every recovery procedure in the pack depends on a mechanism that cannot currently execute.",
