"h": "6. Performance & Scale",
"md": "\nNo ranked bottleneck touches this component. The estate rule still binds it: bound anything that fans out — pods per micro-batch, connections per pod, retries per work item, calls per poll window. Every unbounded fan-out in this design eventually lands on the same Oracle.",
