"h": "6. Performance & Scale",
"md": "\nSizing is unresolved because micro-batch cadence and volume are both unstated. Instrument the ratio of micro-batch duration to cadence interval and treat 0.7 as the ceiling — above it there is no recovery headroom left and a small latency regression becomes an unbounded backlog.",
