"h": "3. Design Decisions",
"md": "\nNo review finding against this component: the events-primary substitution does not change what it does. The design decisions that remain are build decisions. The weakest-covered plane in the pack. D.1 to D.6 are data-correction procedures; there is no disaster recovery section in any document, no RPO, no RTO and no failover story.",
