"h": "5. Data Quality, Reconciliation & Lineage",
"md": "\nNo DQ or reconciliation obligation specific to this component. Two estate rules bind it: anything derived stores the input it was derived from — the threshold in force, the ruleset version, the counts — so a verdict can be reproduced months later; and an unknown value raises rather than being mapped to its nearest neighbour.",
