"h": "7. Error Handling, Failure & Replay",
"md": "\nWithout it nothing can be late, only absent. On the event channel lateness is derivable from the stream's own rhythm; on every other channel it needs a stated expectation.",
"blocks": [
{
"t": "p",
"x": "Without it nothing can be late, only absent. On the event channel lateness is derivable from the stream's own rhythm; on every other channel it needs a stated expectation."
}
]
